                    b: 'Correct — L_eq is the energy-average: the constant level that would deliver the same total sound energy over the measurement window, which is the standard summary for a time-varying source and the basis of noise-exposure limits.',
                    c: 'The minimum understates the source; it is not a conservative or standard summary.',
                    d: 'A single instantaneous reading of a fluctuating source is essentially random and not representative.',
