                    b: 'Sampling AT the signal frequency is insufficient; Nyquist requires MORE than twice, so 20 kHz is inadequate for a 20 kHz signal.',
                    c: 'Correct — you must sample at more than 2× the highest frequency, so just above 40 kHz; this is why CD uses 44.1 kHz (Nyquist limit 22.05 kHz).',
