                      b: 'Correct — +6 dB is well above the roughly −2 to +2 dB target ISO 3382-1 / common concert-hall practice associates with good symphonic sound, indicating a clear but overly dry hall.',
                      c: 'A strongly positive C80 means abundant EARLY energy, not an absence of early reflections.',
