                      b: 'Correct — S12.60 caps small core learning spaces at 0.6 s unoccupied RT and 35 dBA one-hour-average background noise (larger rooms up to 566 m³ get 0.7 s).',
                      c: '0.1 s is anechoic-dead and 20 dBA is quieter than most quiet rooms — far stricter than the standard and impractical.',
                      d: '1.5 s and 45 dBA are roughly what FAILING classrooms measure, not the standard\'s limits.',
