                      b: 'Correct — absorptive curtains/panels raise or lower A, and openable coupled chambers raise or lower the effective V; both are the levers Sabine exposes for changing RT.',
                      c: 'Frequency is a property of the sound, not a design lever for RT; the room changes A and V.',
