                      b: 'Correct — mode n has n−1 interior nodes, so the 4th harmonic (sin(4πx/L)) has 3 interior nodes, at L/4, L/2, and 3L/4.',
                      c: '2 would be the interior nodes of the 3rd harmonic (n−1 = 2), not the 4th.',
