                      b: 'Initial energy depends on pluck position, not simply on frequency; the decisive factor is the faster DECAY of high partials, not a smaller start.',
                      c: 'Reflection at fixed ends is essentially complete for all partials; it is not the reason high partials fade.',
                      d: 'A plucked string is not re-driven at all; it rings down freely after the single pluck.',
