                      b: 'It is a physics-driven choice, not mere tradition: the strike point selects which modes get energy.',
                      c: 'The centre is a node of the higher nodal-diameter modes and the ANTINODE of the (0,1) boom mode — striking there does the opposite of what is wanted.',
