                      b: 'Correct — Gunnar Fant\'s "Acoustic Theory of Speech Production" (1960) is the canonical formalization, building on Chiba & Kajiyama (1941) and Dudley\'s Bell Labs vocoder work.',
                      c: 'Békésy won the Nobel Prize for the cochlear traveling wave (hearing), not for the source-filter model of production.',
