                      b: 'Correct — delayed reflections interfere with the direct sound, producing frequency-dependent reinforcement and cancellation (comb filtering) that overlays the room\'s signature onto the instrument\'s spectrum.',
                      c: 'The FFT computes fine regardless of the room; the issue is that what it analyzes is contaminated.',
