                      b: 'Rw + C = 39 is the speech/activity-noise estimate, appropriate for a talking neighbour, not for road traffic.',
                      c: 'Correct — road traffic is the Ctr case, so Rw + Ctr = 40 + (-6) = 34 dB is the honest estimate against a busy road.',
