                      b: '0.049 is the constant for imperial units (V in cubic feet), not metric; using it with cubic metres is wrong.',
                      c: 'This inverts the relationship — reverberation is proportional to volume and inversely proportional to absorption, so A cannot be in the numerator over V.',
                      d: 'Absorption belongs in the denominator (more absorption → shorter RT60), not the numerator.',
