                      b: 'Correct — maximum reduction ≈ −10·log₁₀(1 − γ²) = −10·log₁₀(1 − 0.90) = −10·log₁₀(0.10) = 10 dB.',
                      c: '30 dB would require γ² = 0.999; a coherence of 0.90 caps the achievable cancellation at about 10 dB.',
                      d: '3 dB corresponds to γ² ≈ 0.5; a coherence of 0.90 gives roughly 10 dB, not 3 dB.',
