                      c: 'Wrong — Leq is an ENERGY average (10·log of the mean of 10^(L/10)), not an arithmetic average of the dB numbers; arithmetic averaging of decibels is a common error.',
                      d: 'The opposite — because of energy weighting, loud events dominate Leq rather than being removed.',
