                      b: 'Correct — endolymph is high-K⁺, low-Na⁺ (cell-like), and this composition, plus the positive endocochlear potential, is the battery that drives hair-cell transduction.',
                      c: 'Endolymph is a liquid; the middle-ear cavity is air-filled, but the cochlear scalae are fluid.',
