                      c: 'Force plates are for measuring ground-reaction forces in biomechanics; they are unrelated to auditory forced-choice detection.',
                      d: 'The psychometric function still exists (percent correct still rises with level from 50% toward 100%); forced-choice just anchors its floor and removes bias.',
