                      c: 'Bone conduction is a delivery route for sound to the cochlea, not a frequency-coding mechanism, and the ">8 kHz only" claim is fabricated.',
                      d: 'The ossicles perform impedance matching (mechanical power transfer), not pitch encoding.',
