                      b: 'Correct — Ritsma (1967) localized the dominant pitch information to about the 3rd–5th harmonics, the low resolved region, which is a key point for spectral/resolved-harmonic models.',
                      c: 'The fundamental need not be present at all (the missing fundamental), so it cannot be the sole determinant.',
