                      b: 'Correct — the gerbil data showed peak ITD sensitivity slopes lying outside the physiological range and a role for precisely timed inhibition, pointing to a two-channel rate/hemispheric-opponent readout rather than a fine-grained delay-line place map.',
                      c: 'Mammals localize sound well; the debate is about the CODE, not the ability.',
