                      b: 'Correct — HIFU requires high output pressure to deposit therapeutic energy, and piezoelectrics (PZT, or high-coupling PMN-PT single crystals) give the best transmit efficiency and pressure per volt.',
                      c: 'HIFU operates in the MHz band, outside the efficient range of magnetostrictive drivers.',
