                      b: 'Correct — a fluid-filled cyst attenuates little, so more energy reaches the tissue behind it than beside it, producing a characteristic bright posterior-enhancement band that flags the lesion as cystic.',
                      c: 'Bone is a very strong attenuator/reflector and casts a shadow, not an enhancement.',
