                      b: 'Correct — spectral fits imply interior temperatures on the order of 10,000–20,000 K during the final instant, hotter than the solar surface, which is the widely cited result.',
                      c: 'Fusion-scale temperatures were the essence of the discredited "bubble fusion" claim; standard SBSL does not reach them.',
