                      b: 'Correct — removing the DC/sub-band energy that integration would otherwise amplify, then integrating (frequency-domain integration lets you simply zero the offending low bins), yields a clean velocity spectrum and RMS.',
                      c: 'No filtering is exactly what causes the runaway low-frequency drift.',
