                      b: 'Correct — even a 10⁴–10⁵ K bubble is about a thousand times too cold for the ~10⁸ K required to overcome the Coulomb barrier for D-D fusion at useful rates.',
                      c: 'Sonoluminescence proves sound CAN concentrate energy dramatically; the point is that the concentration still falls short of fusion conditions.',
